        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2 - Copy",
            "id": 130807,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In TypeScript, i tipi intersezione ti permettono di combinare più tipi in un unico tipo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Employee = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" employeeId: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" PersonEmployee = Person &amp; Employee;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>PersonEmployee</code>, seguito da <code>&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 130604,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per creare un tipo intersezione, usiamo <code>&amp;</code> per combinare più tipi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Employee = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" employeeId: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" PersonEmployee = Person &amp; Employee;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"|\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 130605,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una variabile di un tipo intersezione deve soddisfare <strong>tutti</strong> i tipi combinati.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Employee = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" employeeId: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" PersonEmployee = Person &amp; Employee;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" someone: PersonEmployee = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Miriam&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" employeeId: \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(someone.name, someone.employeeId);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"153\" endIndex=\"168\" /><option startIndex=\"170\" endIndex=\"183\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"isAvailable: true\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Miriam 5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>name: \"Miriam\",</code>, seguito da <code>employeeId: 5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 130606,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se proviamo ad assegnare un valore che non è compatibile con entrambi i tipi, TypeScript genererà un errore. Imposta il <strong>tipo errato</strong> per visualizzare l'errore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Employee = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" employeeId: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" PersonEmployee = Person &amp; Employee;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: PersonEmployee = { name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Amelia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" }; \" /><text value=\"// Error\" class=\"comment\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"146\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Person\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Error: Type &quot;{ name: string; }&quot; is not assignable to type &quot;PersonEmployee&quot; - Property &quot;employeeId&quot; is missing in type &quot;{ name: string; }&quot; but required in type &quot;Employee&quot;.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>PersonEmployee</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy",
            "id": 130808,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare i tipi di intersezione per estendere i tipi personalizzati, consentendoci di creare tipi più completi. Lo facciamo con il simbolo <code>&amp;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Employee = Person &amp; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" employeeId: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: Employee = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lucas&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" employeeId: \" /><text value=\"123\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(person.name, person.employeeId);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Lucas 123\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Person</code>, seguito da <code>&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 130607,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La potenza dei tipi intersezione sta nel combinare i tipi esistenti per ottenere la massima flessibilità nel nostro codice TypeScript.</p><p>Prova a creare un tipo intersezione da tre diversi tipi oggetto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" User = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" username: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ContactInfo = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" email: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Address = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  city: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" UserProfile = User &amp; ContactInfo &amp; Address;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"140\" /><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"152\" /><option startIndex=\"153\" endIndex=\"162\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number[]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>User &amp;</code>, seguito da <code>ContactInfo</code> e infine <code>&amp; Address</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 130608,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il modo corretto di scrivere un tipo intersezione tra <code>User</code> e <code>Admin</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>User &amp; Admin</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>User and Admin</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>User &amp; Admin</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 130610,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale di questi causerà un errore?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Square = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" length: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Colorful = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" color: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ColorfulSquare = Square &amp; Colorful; \" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>let rect: ColorfulSquare = { length: 5 };</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let rect: ColorfulSquare = { length: 5,  color: \"blue\" };</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>let rect: ColorfulSquare = { length: 5 };</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 130611,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea un nuovo tipo di intersezione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Vehicle = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  make: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  model: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Features = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  hasSunroof: \" /><text value=\"boolean\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  hasNavigation: \" /><text value=\"boolean\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" VehicleWithFeatures = Vehicle &amp; Features;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"160\" endIndex=\"161\" /><option startIndex=\"162\" endIndex=\"170\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"|\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"AND\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>&amp;</code>, seguito da <code>Features</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9 - Copy",
            "id": 130809,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assicurati che <code>Pet</code> abbia anche gli attributi di <code>Animal</code>. Quindi crea una variabile di tipo <code>Pet</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Animal = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" species: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"type\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Pet = Animal &amp; {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" myPet: Pet = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" species: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dog&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Buddy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(myPet.species, myPet.name, myPet.age);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Animal\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Pet\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"|\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Dog Buddy 5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>Animal</code>, seguito da <code>&amp;</code> e infine <code>Pet</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
